WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH!
WHAT'S UP, LOSER?

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:13.847
&gt;&gt; WHATCHA READING THERE?
&gt;&gt; A LITTLE COMIC BOOK.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:16.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT'S A MANGA?
&gt;&gt; GIVE IT BACK!

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OR WHAT?
