00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:19.853
&gt;&gt; LITTLE BITCH IS GOING TO CRY?
&gt;&gt; HEY!

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:21.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪
&gt;&gt; LEAVE MY LITTLE BROTHER

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:37.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
