THIS GUY IS STILL COOL.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.015
&gt;&gt; THANKS, JONAS.
&gt;&gt; SO WHAT IF HE'S NEVER KISSED

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
A GIRL.
BIG FREAKIN' DEAL!

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:51.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
THIS GUY PRACTICES KISSING ALL
THE TIME.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:52.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ALL THE TIME.
&gt;&gt; AND GUESS WHAT?

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.721
NEWS FLASH!
OUR MOM SAYS HE'S GETTING PRETTY

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:55.989
DAMN GOOD AT IT.
OH, YOU THINK HE'S WEIRD, RIGHT?

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:58.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
WHY?
BECAUSE HE SLEEPS IN OUR

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:01.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
