&gt;&gt; SOMETIMES.

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:06.099
&gt;&gt; OR BECAUSE HE HAS TO WEAR
PRESCRIPTION CHARCOAL UNDERWEAR

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:07.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
FOR HIS MEDICAL GAS.
?

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:12.238
BUSTED!
I'LL TELL YOU WHAT, I THINK HE'S

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
BRAVE.
&gt;&gt; YO, THIS BITCH?

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:18.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
BRAVE?
I DON'T KNOW ABOUT THAT.

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:19.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
CAST YOUR MIND, IMAGINE THIS,

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:24.384
GOING INTO THE SCHOOL BATHROOM
AND TAKING A DUMP SO BAD THEY

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:25.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
