&gt;&gt; NO!

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:27.687
&gt;&gt; BUT STILL, SOMEHOW, HE SHOWS
UP TO SCHOOL THE NEXT DAY WITH

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:28.621 align:start size:94% position:6%
