HE DID THAT.

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:30.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS YOU?
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:33.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
MAYBE.
&gt;&gt; YOU LOOK AT DAMIAN, AND ALL

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:35.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
