A LOSER.

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:37.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; A KID WITH A LIST OF JOCKS
NAMES IN HIS WALLET.

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:41.000
&gt;&gt; THAT'S CONCERNING.
&gt;&gt; TO YOU, HE'S JUST A KID THAT

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.603
