00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT.
LET'S GET OUT OF HERE.

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:49.843
&gt;&gt; BUT IF YOU HAD A BIRTHMARK
SHAPED LIKE A SWASTIKA YOU

00:01:49.843 --> 00:01:51.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
