&gt;&gt; PLEASE STOP.

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I'M WITH DAMIAN, JONAS.
MAYBE JUST STOP.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.048
&gt;&gt; WHY?
SO YOU CAN MAKE FUN OF HIM AGAIN

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:57.617
