&gt;&gt; I DIDN'T EVEN KNOW ABOUT

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
THAT.
&gt;&gt; OR HIS INVERTED FORE SKIN,

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
MAYBE.
&gt;&gt; OR THAT.

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:04.891
&gt;&gt; SEE, MAYBE IF YOUR FORE SKIN
GREW DOWN TOWARD THE BASE,

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:08.528
INSTEAD OF UP TOWARD THE TIP,
YOU WOULD HAVE A LITTLE BIT OF

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:10.130
SYMPATHY FOR WHAT THIS DUDE HAS
BEEN THROUGH.

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:12.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT THAT WEIRD.
&gt;&gt; 15 SURGERIES TO CORRECT IT.

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:15.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; MINOR.
&gt;&gt; CONSTANT CLEANING.

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:17.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; Q-TIPS, ALCOHOL.
&gt;&gt; ALCOHOL?

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.473
