BECAUSE IT DOESN'T LOOK RIGHT.

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:24.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; EVERYONE'S A CRITIC.
&gt;&gt; WAIT, SORRY.

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:29.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOUR MOM?
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:34.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
HE'S MY BROTHER AND HE'S COOL
ENOUGH FOR ME.

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:35.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪
♪

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:38.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; GO, DAMIAN.
GO.

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:40.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH!
&gt;&gt; AWW, HE DOOKIED HIMSELF.

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:42.162
&gt;&gt; HEY, DON'T THINK THAT IT WAS
YOUR BULLYING THAT MADE HIM DO

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:47.700
